Z||000008||sqoach||12-08-2000||03:16 PM||||beginning to think i need a new radiator cap. i burped the system good this time. had car idling for about 5 minutes, then took it out for a spin. it did fine for about 10-15 minutes. temp was rising very slowly, but steadily. probably because i had my fan on. but then it just starts to go way up, then it came back down below halfway mark. then it goes up again. i took it home right after that, popped the hood and noticed the coolant level was considerably higher. i think the cap doesn't have enough pressure, which lets the coolant out, and that lets air in which messes up my temp gauge. sound right? i'm not sure on that just guessing. any1 else have any ideas? thanks.||||reg||1
